From 9b71806318e1653e4b9d31d1e165099c451ccb02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@avtonarx.local>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 07:57:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(parser): balance timeout/chunk config, speed up requests,
 daily model discovery, purge command
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- OlxUzAdapter: HTTP timeout 20s->15s (root cause of the two consecutive
  30-min FAIL runs on 08-03/08-04 — it inflated every successful request's
  worst case, pushing chunk runtime past the chunk job's own timeout).
  PAGE_REQUEST_DELAY_SECONDS 2s->1s.
- RunParserSourceJob: CHUNK_SIZE 40->20 for extra safety margin.
- RunParserTargetsChunkJob: timeout 1800s->3300s (still under the queue
  worker's 3600s limit); REQUEST_DELAY_SECONDS 3s->1s.
- DiscoverOlxModelsJob: REQUEST_DELAY_SECONDS 4s->1s.
- routes/console.php: brand/model discovery now run daily (was weekly for
  models), sequenced brand -> model -> scrape.
- New listings:purge-stale command: one-time cleanup of long-inactive
  listings instead of wiping the whole table daily (which ExpireStaleListingsJob
  already handles hourly for the active/inactive transition).
